WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.750
ZenNotes now identifies the exact local note that conflicts with Cloud.

00:03.750 --> 00:07.200
Open Compare & resolve to inspect both complete versions before choosing.

00:07.200 --> 00:11.250
The latest local edit is visible beside the older Cloud copy.

00:11.250 --> 00:14.250
Keep the device version directly—no manual rename or duplicate file.

00:14.250 --> 00:17.850
ZenNotes updates Cloud and returns the vault to a clean, verified sync.
